  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/LUK.9.60",
   "range": "LUK.9.60",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "839fdfc6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/LUK.9.60#p1-57b4e5e3",
     "text": "Christ here happily alludeth to that which Elisha did, 1Ki 19:19. Ploughmen that look back cannot but make baulks. {a}",
     "anchor": "No man having put his hand",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 19:19",
       "ref": "1KI.19.19"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/LUK.9.60#p2-9a2c0495",
     "text": "A ridge left in ploughing; a miss, slip. ŒD",
